1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:03,490
The Moon swings two Earths closer on November twenty-fourth.

2
00:00:03,670 --> 00:00:06,670
If Earth were a nickel, the Moon is a coffee bean.

3
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:09,460
Normally thirty Earths fit between us.

4
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:14,970
This Supermoon passes three hundred and sixty thousand kilometres up.

5
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:16,760
Look east at sunset.
